                                "sense_id": "2fcfe581-ddae-3241-9b91-3826872877a3",
                                "text": "Sylvia Lancaster is the founder of the Sophie Lancaster Foundation, a campaigning charitable organisation formed in the wake of her daughter Sophie's tragic murder in 2007."
